Project: Exact Temporal Range Queries through Local State Windows

The native solver is adapted from the supplied D011 operator source,
which in turn identifies the frozen D005 operator as its origin. The portable
Python implementation follows those algorithms and the accompanying paper.
See docs/provenance.md for exact source identities and adaptation scope.

